Dear Craig Jacobs at Bay Dental Rooms,

Welcome to the November 2026 edition of the Bushveld Timber monthly newsletter. Thank you for being a valued customer.

Product news this month includes new stock of treated pine decking boards and eucalyptus garden poles in a range of lengths. We have also restocked our exterior varnish and wood oil range for summer projects. Pop in to browse the new displays when you are in the area.

Seasonal tip for early summer: with hot days and afternoon rain expected, store any untreated timber under cover and allow good airflow between boards. A fresh coat of sealant now will help decking and outdoor furniture last well through the rainy season.

Thank you for your support. We welcome feedback on what you would like to see in future editions.

Kind regards
Marike Botha
Bushveld Timber

